  "definition": "Eligible Costs",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-05-01",
  "historyNote": "#7492, eff 5-18-01; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1300); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 3002.02); ss by #10599, eff 7-1-14; ss by #13622, eff 5-1-23",
